    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O’Connor Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 35 Riverbank Hall to the market, a superb ground floor 2 bedroom apartment located in the ever popular Addison Park development which was built by the renowned Park Developments. This apartment offers bright modern contemporary living space with 2 double bedrooms and a large bright living room which has access to a large terrace area suitable for al fresco dining. The property also benefits from an underground car parking space. Visitor parking is also available within the development.\r\n\r\nThe apartment briefly comprises of an entrance hall, open plan living Room and kitchen, 2 double bedrooms, ensuite, storage and bathroom.\r\n\r\nAddison Park is one of the more popular and well renowned developments with mature & pristine landscaped areas containing a vibrant mix of apartments, duplexes and houses that offer a secure and tranquil setting only minutes from the village of Glasnevin. This prestigious development also has stunning southerly views towards the Dublin Mountains and Botanical Gardens.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nAccommodation provides:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: with floor tiling, intercom and access to large storage area.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining area: c.5.56m x 3.42m with contemporary wooden floors and access to large terrace area.\r\n\r\nKitchen: c.2.99m x 2.24m with built in kitchen units, flooring, and window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 5.57m x 2.88m with wooden floors, built in wardrobe and access to terrace.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: c.1.70m x 1.51m with wc, whb and shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c.4.39m x 2.82m with wooden floors, built in wardrobe and access to terrace.\r\n\r\nBathroom: c.1.86m x 1.73m tiled with bath & shower, vanity unit, wc and whb.\r\n\r\n\r\nTransport: This property has the convenience of the M50 & M1 within close proximity which opens up the convenience of the entire county & country. There are numerous bus routes within a stone throws distance which includes a regular bus service to the City Centre. Dublin Airport is also within close proximity.\r\n\r\nAmenities: The Botanical Gardens and a wide array of shops, bars and restaurants are all within striking distance. This superbly positioned property is a short stroll from the quaint village of Glasnevin. There are educational facilities in abundance not to mention DCU which is located nearby. Bons Secours Hospital is also within a short stroll."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
